sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Payer
    actor R as Receiver
    participant APP as Mobile App
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    P->>APP: Submit payment confirmation
    APP->>API: POST /api/roomspaces/:id/payments/confirm
    API->>DB: Insert pending confirmation
    DB-->>API: Saved
    API-->>APP: Pending status
    APP-->>P: Confirmation submitted

    R->>APP: Open pending confirmations
    APP->>API: GET /api/roomspaces/:id/payments/pending
    API->>DB: Fetch pending records
    DB-->>API: Pending list
    API-->>APP: Pending list

    R->>APP: Approve confirmation
    APP->>API: PUT /api/roomspaces/:id/payments/:paymentId/confirm
    API->>DB: Update status = confirmed
    API->>DB: Update balances/settlement records
    DB-->>API: Updated
    API-->>APP: Confirmed response
    APP-->>R: Show success
